SPDX-License-Identifier: LGPL-2.1-or-later AND MIT

ModernIME is distributed under a composite license because the repository and
binary packages combine ModernIME's own source code with derived offline lexical
datasets from permissive open-source projects:

1. ModernIME Source Code, Binaries, UI Addon, Settings Client, and Scripts
   - Paths: core/, algorithm/, adapter/, ui/, tools/, config/, scripts/,
     packaging/, cmake/, tests/, data/pinyin/modernime-hotwords.raw
   - License: GNU Lesser General Public License v2.1 or later (LGPL-2.1-or-later)

2. Offline Pinyin Knowledge Dictionary & English Definition Dictionary Data
   - Paths:
     * data/pinyin/modernime-knowledge.tsv
     * data/pinyin/modernime-knowledge.raw
     * share/modernime/pinyin/modernime-knowledge.dict (compiled binary dictionary)
     * data/pinyin/modernime-english-dict.bin
   - License: MIT License (with ModernIME curated additions under LGPL-2.1-or-later AND MIT)
   - Upstream Attributions:
     * China-idiom (https://github.com/sfyc23/China-idiom) — Copyright (c) 2019 Thunder Bouble (MIT)
     * THUOCL (https://github.com/thunlp/THUOCL) — Copyright (c) 2018 THUNLP (MIT)
     * python-pinyin (https://github.com/mozillazg/python-pinyin) — Copyright (c) 2016 mozillazg (MIT)
     * ECDICT (https://github.com/skywind3000/ECDICT) — Copyright (c) Lin Wei / Skywind (MIT)
   - Full third-party copyright notices and exact upstream commit hashes are
     preserved in `data/pinyin/THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` and `data/pinyin/SOURCES.json`.

